   Header: {... Authorization: Bearer Awd18wC...}   (login POST minted a token => auth succeeded)

Result: login succeeded, reached Home dashboard (Orders/Earnings/Profile, balance د.إ 150 rendered).
No new exception on the request path. PerfHttp.start/stop wrap each call additively.

PII NOTE: endpoints carry ?token= in the URL (delivery-man/profile?token=, latest-orders?token=).
The api_client log already masks it (?token=*** via NEARS-463). PerfHttp.sanitizeUrl independently
drops the entire query string before the HttpMetric URL, so no token reaches Firebase Performance.
